支配株主に帰属するものとして非支配株主に帰属する当期純利益において控除します。仮に当社グループ外の出資者持分の損益をはじめから除外した場合の2027年３月期連結業績予想数値は、売上高26,470百万円、営業利益4,090百万円、経常利益3,940百万円、親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益2,900百万円となります。3.当社グループは、M&Aアドバイザリー等の成功報酬型コンサルティング案件の売上実現時期により期中での業績変動が大きく、第２四半期（累計）での連結業績予想数値の算出が困難であること、及び業績管理は年次ベースで行っていることから、第２四半期（累計）の連結業績予想は記載いたしません。", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ForecastMember"], ["SignificantChangesInTheScopeOfConsolidationDuringThePeriod", "SignificantChangesInTheScopeOfConsolidationDuringThePeriod", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "有", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["NumberOfSubsidiariesNewlyConsolidated", "NumberOfSubsidiariesNewlyConsolidated", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 1, "1", "NumberOfCompanies", "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["NameOfSubsidiariesNewlyConsolidated", "NameOfSubsidiariesNewlyConsolidated", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "Takenaka Securities,LLC", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ApplyingOfSpecificAccountingOfTheConsolidatedQuarterlyFinancialStatements", "ApplyingOfSpecificAccountingOfTheConsolidatedQuarterlyFinancialStatements", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "ChangesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesOtherThanOnesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "ChangesOtherThanOnesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesInAccountingEstimates", "ChangesInAccountingEstimates", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["RetrospectiveRestatement", "RetrospectiveRestatement", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentAccumulatedQ1Duration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期末発行済株式数", "NumberOfI